  {"id": "function:packages/host/open-in-app/src/resolver.ts:findDesktopEntry", "type": "function", "name": "findDesktopEntry", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/src/resolver.ts", "lineRange": [405, 417], "summary": "按优先序遍 XDG 数据目录 applications/ 找 desktopId.desktop 并解析 Exec/TryExec/Icon 字段。", "tags": ["xdg", "desktop-entry"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/open-in-app/src/resolver.ts:locate", "type": "function", "name": "locate", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/src/resolver.ts", "lineRange": [462, 602], "summary": "单个 locator 到已验证启动器：fixed 信任 OS 自带、app 扫 bundle 目录、xcode 跟 xcode-select -p、cli 经 PATH 解析（requiresDesktop 先探显示）、file 展开候选、scan 数值感知版本扫描、app-paths/install-record 走注册表视图、github-desktop 版本化 exe+cli.js 成对验证、desktop 读 XDG 条目推导启动器。", "tags": ["locator-dispatch", "verification", "closed-union"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/open-in-app/src/resolver.ts:resolveLaunch", "type": "function", "name": "resolveLaunch", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/src/resolver.ts", "lineRange": [612, 618], "summary": "解析单条目：SSH 启动直接 null，否则本平台 locator 顺序尝试取首个已验证启动器。", "tags": ["resolution", "ssh-guard"], "complexity": "simple"},
