  {"id": "document:packages/host/plugin-inventory/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/plugin-inventory/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-plugin-inventory 包 README：客户端经 pluginInventory/list 显示 host 当前插件（加载序、entry id、模块说明符、生效启用态、live phase、展示元数据）；有 agent-preset roster 的部署附每 preset 元数据/健康/扁平组合；只读时点快照，不能变更插件也无历史订阅。", "tags": ["documentation", "plugin-inventory", "remote-service"], "complexity": "moderate"},
