  {"id": "file:packages/host/plugin-inventory/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/plugin-inventory/src/index.ts", "summary": "Loader 插件条目的只读投影：PluginInventoryGateway 是 TypertRemoteService 子类（@Remote('list')），每次调用直读 Loader（Cordis 内部 plugin/status 事件已维护 Fiber 状态，二缓存只会多一份要同步的生命周期真相）；失败 fiber await 取诊断，agent-preset roster 组合时附每 preset 组合行。", "tags": ["remote-service", "typert-gateway", "read-only-projection"], "complexity": "moderate"},
