  {"id": "function:packages/host/plugin-inventory/src/index.ts:readPluginInventory", "type": "function", "name": "readPluginInventory", "filePath": "packages/host/plugin-inventory/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [82, 121], "summary": "遍历 Loader.entries() 组装快照：跳过 group、fiberPhase 映射（FiberState 跨包 const enum 用运行时镜像表）、failed fiber await 取 diagnostic、pluginPackages metaOf 补展示元数据；roster 存在时附组合清单。", "tags": ["snapshot-assembly", "fiber-states"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/plugin-inventory/src/types.ts", "type": "file", "name": "types.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/plugin-inventory/src/types.ts", "summary": "盘点类型：Branded PluginEntryId、PluginFiberPhase（pending/loading/active/failed/unloading|null）、PluginInventoryEntry（entryId/moduleName/meta/enabled/fiberPhase/diagnostic）与快照/预设组合行类型。", "tags": ["type-definition", "branded-id", "fiber-phases"], "complexity": "simple"},
