  {"id": "document:packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-product-telemetry-otel 包 README：把选定的产品使用事件送 OTLP/HTTP collector——事件带名/字符串摘要/发生时间/标量或一层对象属性；挂载不自动采集，应用显式逐事件提交；投递尽力而为不确认入库。", "tags": ["documentation", "telemetry", "otlp"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-product-telemetry-otel 包清单：产品遥测适配器的依赖与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/src/index.ts", "summary": "共享 Cordis OTel 服务的分析策略适配器：ProductTelemetry（Service 子类，inject otel，ctx.productTelemetry）构造时校验 endpoint/channel/批量上界后在 ctx.otel 上建 EventLogReporter（OTLP logs exporter+批处理器参数+失败告警），effect 卸载带 shutdown 超时取消；emit 入队不等待网络投递。", "tags": ["service-provider", "otel-adapter", "batching"], "complexity": "moderate", "languageNotes": "默认 collector 端点 deepseeksvc.com/v1/logs、channel dsh_otel_report；maxExportBatchSize 不得超过 maxQueueSize 在构造期校验。"},
  {"id": "class:packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/src/index.ts:ProductTelemetry", "type": "class", "name": "ProductTelemetry", "filePath": "packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [61, 121], "summary": "host 分析发送服务：构造校验（URL/header 值合法性、协议限 http/https、批量上界）后建 EventLogReporter；卸载时 shutdownTimeoutMillis 内 drain，超时 abort 未决导出并告警；emit 仅入队。", "tags": ["service-provider", "lifecycle", "telemetry"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/host/product-telemetry-otel/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/webserver/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/webserver/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-webserver 包 README：浏览器经 node:http（tls 配证书则 https）到达 Web GUI——其他插件注册命名路由/upgrade 路由/索引启动注入与一个 fallback；不服务任何文件（/api 桥、插件 bundle、HMR 事件流、SPA dist 都属注册它们的插件）；路由匹配固定：全表 exact→最长 prefix→fallback；仅服务浏览器，Electron 走 file://+IPC 桥。", "tags": ["documentation", "http-server", "route-registration"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/webserver/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/webserver/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver 包清单：HTTP 载体服务的依赖（compression/ipaddr.js/negotiator）与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/webserver/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/webserver/src/index.ts", "summary": "浏览器 HTTP 载体服务：WebServer（Service 子类，ctx.webServer）持有 exact/prefix/upgrade 三张路由表与唯一 fallback 席位，Config 拒绝通配绑定地址（会把 RCE 暴露到全网）、TLS 材料读失败拒绝初始化不回退 HTTP；gzip 中间件（阈值/级别可配）、Fetch Response 写回 node 响应的背压流、webserver/index-inject 事件收集结构化索引注入；TLS 握手中连接单独持有保证 close 不被挂起。", "tags": ["service-provider", "http-server", "tls", "route-tables"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "路由 handler 保留直接响应所有权（可持住 SSE），resource 形态把 Fetch Request 映射 Response 并兼答进程内读取；isLoopbackHost/normalizeBindAddress 等被 directory-picker-auto 复用。"},
